{"id": 1013927, "slug": "dark-quest-4", "name": "Dark Quest 4", "name_original": "Dark Quest 4", "description": "<h3>Darkness Stirs Once More </h3><p>Dark Quest returns with its fourth installment - a turn-based strategy adventure inspired by the legendary HeroQuest board game. Enter a realm of perilous dungeons, cunning traps, and powerful magic as you lead your party of heroes against the forces of the Dark Sorcerer.</p><p>The evil Gulak, the sorcerer’s puppet, commands monstrous legions that stalk the night. Villagers vanish without a trace - stolen in silence, never to be seen again. Only your band of champions can stand against this tide of darkness and end Gulak’s reign of terror.</p><h3> </h3><h3>Strategic Dungeon Adventures </h3><p>Embark on 30 handcrafted quests filled with tactical, turn-based combat and deadly surprises. Outsmart over 40 unique monsters, evade lethal traps, and wield both magic and steel to survive sprawling, multi-floored dungeons that test your wit and courage.</p><h3>Build Your Party of Heroes </h3><p>Command up to 10 unique heroes, each with distinctive stats and powers. Train them in the Hero Camp, unlock new cards and abilities, and forge your perfect dungeon-delving team.</p><h3>Online Multiplayer</h3><p>Team up with friends online or locally in couch co-op up to 3 players, combining your heroes’ strengths to overcome Gulak’s legions. Explore together and find treasures to fill your purses!</p><h3>Creator Mode </h3><p>Step into the role of the Creator - design your own quests, build intricate dungeons, and shape adventures for others to explore. Play, share, and discover community-made quests from players around the world, or craft your own original challenges to test the bravest heroes.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-11-05", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-11-07T09:58:33", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/903/903ff7a2c05f4d0597e7ef6f43a12383.jpg", "background_imag