over 40 unique monsters, evade lethal traps, and wield both magic and steel to survive sprawling, multi-floored dungeons that test your wit and courage.Build Your Party of Heroes Command up to 10 unique heroes, each with distinctive stats and powers. Train them in the Hero Camp, unlock new cards and abilities, and forge your perfect dungeon-delving team.Online MultiplayerTeam up with friends online or locally in couch co-op up to 3 players, combining your heroes’ strengths to overcome Gulak’s legions. Explore together and find treasures to fill your purses!Creator Mode Step into the role of the Creator - design your own quests, build intricate dungeons, and shape adventures for others to explore. Play, share, and discover community-made quests from players around the world, or craft your own original challenges to test the bravest heroes."}